  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_01",
      "hash64": "C4A6708980CF29D9",
      "text": "同学们好啊。\\n让我们一起快乐地上课吧。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_02",
      "hash64": "C4A66D8980CF24C0",
      "text": "大家是否喜欢占卜呢？[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_03",
      "hash64": "C4A66E8980CF2673",
      "text": "如果在晨间新闻的\\n占卜节目里看到自己运势很好，\\r\\n心情就会不自觉地愉快起来吧？[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_04",
      "hash64": "C4A6738980CF2EF2",
      "text": "今天的主题就与运气相关，\\n来继续学习数字吧！[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_05",
      "hash64": "C4A6748980CF30A5",
      "text": "在宝可梦对战中，\\n偶尔会发生……击中要害了！\\r\\n你们应该都见到过吧？[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_06",
      "hash64": "C4A6718980CF2B8C",
      "text": "击中要害时，\\n伤害会比通常多出一半，\\r\\n也就是１.５倍哦。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_07",
      "hash64": "C4A6728980CF2D3F",
      "text": "何时能击中要害，何时又不能，\\n这些全看运气……看谁更加幸运。\\r\\n而这样的运气因素却会在对战中掀起波澜。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_08",
      "hash64": "C4A6778980CF35BE",
      "text": "那么，有谁知道\\n击中要害的概率是多少吗？[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "7C8CF0001D8940DF",
      "text": "大约１％　（１００次中有１次）",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "7C8CF1001D894292",
      "text": "大约４％　（１００次中有４次）",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "7C8CF2001D894445",
      "text": "大约１２％　（１００次中有１２次）",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "367A6F7BC753DC72",
      "text": "哦呵呵，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n要害比你想的更容易击中哦。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "367A6E7BC753DABF",
      "text": "没错！答得非常好！\\n不愧是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你呢！[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "367A6D7BC753D90C",
      "text": "哦呵呵，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n那样的话要害也太多了吧？[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_09",
      "hash64": "C4A6788980CF3771",
      "text": "据说，准确的击中要害的\\n概率是２４分之１……\\r\\n也就是４.１７％。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_10",
      "hash64": "C4A9F58980D241AF",
      "text": "也有比较容易击中要害的招式，\\n比如尖石攻击和暗影爪，\\r\\n使用它们的话有１２％的概率击中要害！[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_11",
      "hash64": "C4A9F48980D23FFC",
      "text": "使出名为聚气的招式，\\n或者使用名为要害攻击的道具……[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_12",
      "hash64": "C4A9F78980D24515",
      "text": "击中要害的概率就会大幅提高２个等级，\\n能以５０％的概率攻击要害。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_13",
      "hash64": "C4A9F68980D24362",
      "text": "击中要害，欢欢喜喜，\\n被击中要害，哭哭啼啼。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_14",
      "hash64": "C4A9F18980D23AE3",
      "text": "宝可梦对战中所隐藏的\\n概率的数学知识超出我们所想。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_15",
      "hash64": "C4A9F08980D23930",
      "text": "通过计算得到好运的话，\\n或许还能进一步地丰富战术哦。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_16",
      "hash64": "C4A9F38980D23E49",
      "text": "哎呀，下课铃响了？\\n已经到时间了呀，真可惜……[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_03_math_17",
      "hash64": "C4A9F28980D23C96",
      "text": "下次是令人开心的期中考试！\\n大家就满心期待吧。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
